{"score": "no", "reasoning": "Candidate correctly cites UCI webpage (DOI correct) and collector code gist URL. However, fails to identify the critical format difference: the collector code (dota2ApiLoader.py) outputs 15 columns (matchId, win, cluster, game_mode_name as STRING, lobby_name as STRING, 10 raw hero_id values), while the CSV has 117 columns (win, clusterid/gamemode/gametype as integers, 113 one-hot hero indicators). The candidate conflates these formats, describing the collector code as outputting 'result, cluster, game_mode, game_type, hero_1..hero_113' which is the CSV format, not the collector code format. The instruction explicitly requires verifying this difference ('\u6ce8\u610f\u88ab\u5f15\u7528\u91c7\u96c6\u4ee3\u7801\u672a\u5fc5\u76f4\u63a5\u8f93\u51fa\u8be5\u683c\u5f0f'), but the candidate fails to do so and instead conflates the sources."}

