{"score": "yes", "reasoning": "All GA002 data-audit checks are correctly reported and verified against the raw data: split sizes (92650/10294), result labels [-1, 1], exactly 5 heroes per side per row, zero missing values, zero exact duplicates in each split, and zero cross-split row overlap. Crucially, the candidate explicitly disclaims that no match ID column exists and therefore cross-split match-level deduplication cannot be verified \u2014 they do not overclaim to have excluded all leaks. This is reflected both in DataAudit notes (row 17: 'No match IDs available; cannot verify cross-split match-level deduplication') and in the docx limitations section (item 4). Criterion satisfied."}

