{"score": "yes", "reasoning": "All 113 heroes in TrainSignals have correct \u51fa\u573a (total), \u5206\u65b9\u652f\u6301 (radiant/dire counts), \u539f\u59cb\u80dc\u7387, \u9884\u671f\u7387 (stratified-baseline formula), and \u767e\u5206\u70b9\u6821\u6b63\u5dee. Verified against raw training data (92,650 rows, no header): totals/radiant/dire match exactly; raw_wr, expected_wr, and adj_gap match within <5e-7. Test/HoldoutReview and playtest_queue also cross-consistent."}

