{"score": "yes", "reasoning": "Independently recomputed all Frozen Six test-side statistics from the raw input CSVs. All six heroes reproduce exactly: Wilson 95% CI using z=1.96 (lo/hi match to 6 decimals), per-side (stratum-aware) adjusted gap (Test_Adj_Gap matches to 6 decimals), and sparse-layer fallback proportion Test_Sparse_Prop (matches to 4 decimals). Method confirmed: stratum = (cluster, game_mode, game_type); baseline = stratum p\u0302 when stratum\u2265100 train matches else overall p\u0302=0.5265; hero win = (hero_value == result); expected WR averages per-appearance baselines with sign flip for -1 side. All three reproducible quantities cited in GA008 check out."}

